"Triforming is a knight's way of cleansing chaos from a world."
"It lifts millions of thells of soil into the sky and slams it back down."
"It overwrites reality's fractures with a stronger version of the knight's own making."
"It takes one giant semicircular bite from the corruption each day, leaving no trace behind."
"It leaves flat, fertile, chaos-free land and falling dust, with a whumf that shakes the ground."
"It needs atmospheric readings and the altitude and depth of the corruption."
